      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COSMIC REWARD (1) struggled to get involved last start after drifting back at Bendigo, but prior to that won by a neck at Shepparton (22.42) beating Ivory Quill in a Grade 5 on September 2. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Has ability and can bounce back. STARBRIGHT HUD (2) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, the latest scoring at Warrnambool over 450m. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. TALTARNI BLUE (7) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (26.01) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Shapes as one to consider. SUPER SEAFARER (3) is another with top-three prospects.",
